🇷🇺 Key points from Dmitry Peskov's statements:

➡️Stubb's support for strikes on Wildberries warehouses is surprising, since he recently spoke about the need to build dialogue with Russia;

➡️Statements from Stubb and British prime ministers show that the aggressive line toward Russia persists, and Moscow must take countermeasures;

➡️Moscow has repeatedly stated that the deployment of NATO military contingents on Ukrainian territory is unacceptable for Russia;

➡️Russia doesn't merely expect to win the SMO — it is certain of victory;

➡️Russia continues the SMO given the absence of peaceful means of settlement;

➡️Peskov expressed confidence that the Ukrainian question will be raised at Lavrov's meeting with the Vatican's head of diplomacy.

